 "description": "Lists free tiers, signup credits, trial credits and discounts on AI APIs: inference, GPU, search, embeddings, vector databases, speech and vision, eval and observability, and compute sandboxes. Filters by capability and by provider or offer name. Each row gives limits, offer_status, access (what the first call needs: api-key, credit-card, oauth, web-form, phone-verification, account or none, or null), source_url, verified_at and verified_days_ago. A row with access credit-card needs a payment card to get that offer; a null access is not a sign of card-free access. Rows state what the provider advertised on verified_at, not today.",
